}

docs {
  # WADO-RS: Retrieve Instance

  Download a DICOM file.

  ## Path Parameters
  - `studyUID`: Study Instance UID
  - `seriesUID`: Series Instance UID
  - `sopInstanceUID`: SOP Instance UID

  ## Response
  DICOM file (application/dicom)
}
